<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_IV__chp_10__cl_50__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_IV__chp_10__cl_50__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The teaching required in an educational institution under subsection (1) shall be for a period of at least two hours a week within the period of general teaching of the educational institution, or within such other period as the Minister may, in the case of any particular educational institution, appoint."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_IV__chp_10__cl_50__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_IV__chp_10__cl_50> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
