<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_IV__chp_10__cl_50__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The governors or other persons responsible for the management of an educational institution required to provide teaching under this section shall make such arrangements as may be necessary for that purpose."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_IV__chp_10__cl_50__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_IV__chp_10__cl_50> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
