<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_IV__chp_10__cl_50__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "The governors or other persons responsible for the management of two or more educational institutions may, with the approval of the Registrar, make arrangements for teaching under this section to be given to the pupils professing the Islamic religion in the educational institutions jointly."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
