<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_IV__chp_12__cl_65__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Without prejudice to the generality of the powers conferred by section 64, the Minister shall, so far as it is reasonable and practicable so to do, provide for the medical and dental inspection at appropriate intervals of pupils of government or government-aided educational institutions."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_IV__chp_12__cl_65__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_IV__chp_12__cl_65> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
