<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_VIII__chp_1__cl_79__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to the other provisions of this Act, every educational institution shall be registered under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
