<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_VIII__chp_1__cl_81__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Pending investigation on an application made under subsection 79(2), the Registrar General may, in his discretion, issue to the person who is to act as chairman of the board of governors or the person responsible for the management of an educational institution a provisional certificate of registration in such form and subject to such conditions as may be prescribed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
