<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_VIII__chp_1__cl_81__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A provisional certificate of registration issued under subsection (1) may at the discretion of the Registrar General be revoked at any time by notice in writing served on the person to whom the certificate was issued. 46 BILL"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
