<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_VIII__chp_5__cl_102__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any action taken under subsection (1) in respect of any house, building or other place shall not prohibit the Registrar General from prosecuting any person using such house, building or place as an educational institution without being registered under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
