<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_VII__cl_74> <https://schema.org/text> "education or secondary education or both shall comply with the requirements of the National Curriculum and shall prepare pupils for prescribed examinations."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_VII__cl_75> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_VII> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
