<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_135__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A person who is guilty of an offence under this Act for which no penalty is expressly provided shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding five thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_135__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_135> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
