<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_135__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_135__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A person who is guilty of an offence under this Act shall, in the case of a continuing offence, on conviction be liable, in addition to any other penalty to which he is liable under this Act in respect of the offence, to a daily fine not exceeding five hundred ringgit for each day the offence continues to be committed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
