<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_138> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "138" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
