<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_XV__cl_142> <https://schema.org/name> "Except with the permission of the Registrar, a pupil"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_XV__cl_142> <https://schema.org/text> "who is enrolled as a pupil in a government or government- aided educational institution shall not, whilst so enrolled, be enrolled in any other such educational institution."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
