<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@/~part_XV__cl_143> <https://schema.org/text> "in the interests of an educational institution or in the interests of the pupils or the public, by order published in the Gazette, exempt the educational institution or any class or classes of educational institutions from all or any of the provisions of this Act, except the provisions as to registration, either absolutely or subject to such conditions as he may think fit to impose, and may at any time in his discretion revoke the exemption or cancel or alter or add to such conditions. 74 BILL"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/35/eng@> .
